sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant React as Frontend React
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Reverb as Laravel Reverb
    actor Boutique as Propriétaire boutique

    Client->>React: Valider panier (CheckoutModal)
    React->>API: POST /api/orders + Bearer token
    API->>API: Valider items et calculer prix
    API->>DB: Transaction Order + OrderItems
    DB-->>API: Commande créée
    API-->>React: JSON order id + détails
    React-->>Client: Redirection suivi /compte/commandes/{id}

    Note over Client,React: Suivi en temps réel

    Boutique->>React: Met à jour statut (Expédiée)
    React->>API: PUT /boutique/orders/{id}/status
    API->>DB: UPDATE orders.status
    API->>Reverb: Broadcast OrderStatusUpdated
    Reverb-->>React: WebSocket order.{id}
    React-->>Client: Timeline mise à jour
